  "implementation": [
    "Owner-local AdmissionError metadata counts the full containing error once, actual message capacity and optional Diagnostic Box pointee once with all four private String capacities and exhaustive fixed numerical audit. Exclusive Box adds no ordered entries/shared roots.",
    "Concrete WorkerFailure retains detailed original errors through existing single-terminal generation/export queues. Actual generation helper and export spawn wrapper admit errors before send, after finite scientific construction.",
    "If metadata or admission rejects the error, its owned payload drops before a payload-free rejection variant is sent. Named shared static text describes this resource failure without invented diagnostic data. Existing cancel/disconnect text uses static variants.",
    "Generation borrows detailed message/help through response serialization; export retains its detailed guard through response Value construction. Queued error disposal, cancellation priority, previous Ready restoration, disconnected delivery and spawn rollback preserve original behavior.",
    "No scientific algorithm, public API/binding/schema, dependency, CXX/QML registration or generic accounting framework. Fixed control/transport infrastructure, Saved Value and retained presentation remain separate pending owners."
  ],
